WEBVTT

00:12:58.857 --> 00:13:01.318
it's probably the thing
I'm most proud of in my life

00:13:01.318 --> 00:13:03.195
outside of my wife and kids.

00:13:04.363 --> 00:13:06.949
So, yeah, I guess she was right,
it is pretty cool.

00:13:06.949 --> 00:13:08.116
(Laughter)

00:13:09.201 --> 00:13:10.911
These scars,

00:13:10.953 --> 00:13:14.331
they're not just a reminder
of everything I've been through,

00:13:14.331 --> 00:13:17.292
but more so, everything
that's in front of me.

00:13:18.335 --> 00:13:20.003
They stare me in my face.

00:13:21.088 --> 00:13:23.006
Challenging me to be myself.

00:13:23.757 --> 00:13:26.426
To help others out
of their own spirals when I can.

00:13:27.636 --> 00:13:30.806
Now, you might not have a leg
that looks like this.